      "absoluteDifficulty": "Frozen MEDIUM: the revised prompt tests knowledge of tartan’s historical commercialization and military standardization, plus the early use of numbered variants, instead of direct visual recognition of a check. A player familiar with fashion or textile history can connect those clues to tartan; a player outside that subject cannot derive the answer from grammar or an absurd option. All alternatives are real textile pattern names, with houndstooth a particularly close check-pattern alternative."
